# InstantLink vLab Deployment & Management Command Reference

---

## 1. Clean Previous Installation & Deploy

```bash
rm -rf /telecom/ilink/*
rm -rf /telecom/release_area
./manage_releases -s installation_specifications/pa-solution.config -i /telecom/ilink -r /telecom/release_area -p /telecom/packages
```

---

## 2. Configuration File Management

```bash
cp /telecom/packages/installation_specifications/pa-solution.config /telecom/packages/installation_specifications/pa-solution.config.bak
vi /telecom/packages/installation_specifications/pa-solution.config
```

