## 5. PostgreSQL Database Setup

```bash
sudo -i -u postgres
psql
DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS ilink_db;
DROP USER IF EXISTS ilink_user;
CREATE DATABASE ilink_db;
CREATE USER ilink_user WITH PASSWORD 'IlinkPass0465';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE ilink_db TO ilink_user;
\q
```

