## 8. Process Monitoring & Management

```bash
ps -ef | grep ilink
ps -ef | grep java
ps -ef | grep ManagementAgent
kill -9 771833
pkill -u ilink -f ManagementAgent
ps -ef | grep ManagementAgent
```

